# Personal Portfolio Website

## Project Overview
This project is a personal portfolio website developed as part of my Yuva Intern Full Stack Developer Internship – Phase 2.

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3

## Features
- Home section
- About Me section
- Skills section
- Contact section
- Navigation menu
- Simple and clean design

## Project Structure
- index.html – Website structure
- style.css – Website styling

## Tools Used
- Visual Studio Code
- Google Chrome
- GitHub

## Learning Outcomes
Through this project, I practised HTML page structure, CSS styling, webpage layout and basic website development.

